-# The ticket summary for an order's virtual (admission: virtual, e.g.
-# streaming) tickets, rendered inside a paragraph by _performance_confirmation
-# and, with reminder: true, by _performance_reminder. show_charge is true when
-# no in-person summary precedes this one to carry the charge sentence. Access
-# details (stream links) live in the class's purchase_email_annotation, shown
-# under "A few notes about your order".
- virtual_count = order.admission_ticket_count('virtual')
- virtual_only = !order.attends_in_person?
- if local_assigns[:reminder]
  - if virtual_only
    Just a reminder: the stream is at
    = order.performance.performance_time.strftime('%l:%M %p').strip
    this
    = "#{Date::DAYNAMES[order.performance.performance_date.wday]}."
    Access details are in the notes about your order below.
  - else
    You also have
    = pluralize(virtual_count, 'virtual ticket')
    for this performance.
- else
  Your
  = pluralize(virtual_count, 'virtual ticket')
  for
  %i= "#{order.performance.production.name}#{!order.theater.is_default? ? ',' : ''}"
  = "presented by #{order.theater.name}" unless order.theater.is_default?
  on
  = order.performance.performance_date.strftime('%A, %B %_d')
  at
  = order.performance.performance_time.strftime('%l:%M %p').strip
  = virtual_count == 1 ? 'is' : 'are'
  - if !local_assigns[:show_charge]
    confirmed.
  - elsif !order.membership_payments.empty?
    = "confirmed and #{virtual_count == 1 ? 'was' : 'were'} purchased with your #{order.membership_payments.first.membership.membership_offer.name}."
  - elsif !order.flex_pass_payments.empty?
    = "confirmed and #{virtual_count == 1 ? 'was' : 'were'} purchased with your flex pass."
  - elsif order.customer_visible_total <= 0
    confirmed.
  - else
    = "confirmed and the total charge was $#{'%0.2f' % order.customer_visible_total}."
  - if virtual_only
    Access details are in the notes about your order below.
